      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.03608">arXiv:2601.03608</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2601.03608">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2601.03608">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2601.03608">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
      </p>
      <div class="tags is-inline-block">
