        Bradley-Terry Policy Optimization for Generative Preference <span class="search-hit mathjax">Modeling</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Feng%2C+S">Shengyu Feng</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=He%2C+Y">Yun He</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ma%2C+S">Shuang Ma</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+B">Beibin Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xiong%2C+Y">Yuanhao Xiong</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+S">Songlin Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mandyam%2C+K">Karishma Mandyam</a>, 
      
